From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:34:41 +0000
Subject: feat(compose): support reverse lazy native scroll

Expose reverseLayout on LazyColumn/LazyRow (and wire it through the lazy grids) and map
the native ScrollView offset to the Compose logical offset as maxNative - native, so item 0
sits at the native end. A reverse list re-anchors its native offset and placed children when
the content size changes, keeps its echo guard armed under a finger, and keeps its logical
offset across viewport resizes. reverseLayout = false maps every offset unchanged.

Fork-Patch: compose-reverse-lazy-native-scroll
Origin: Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI#1474
Upstream-Status: submitted Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI#1474
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

